ale-20261102-061"}},{"ref":"w4","relation":"works","key":{"native_identity_key":"nlscale:20261102:ol:OL23233100W"},"before":null,"after":{"title":"Leuk zeg doei","author_id":969300004,"first_publish_year":2011,"open_library_id":"OL23233100W","cover_id":12345993,"source_type":"open_library","work_type":"collection","native_identity_key":"nlscale:20261102:ol:OL23233100W","id":987160005}},{"ref":"e4","relation":"editions","key":{"open_library_edition_id":"OL31069272M"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":"@w4","open_library_edition_id":"OL31069272M","isbn_13":"9789020412345","isbn_10":null,"title":"Leuk zeg doei","language":"dut","publisher":"Uitgeverij L. J. Veen","id":987260005,"publish_date":null,"cover_id":12345993}},{"ref":"d4","relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","key":{"work_id":"@w4","language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":"@w4","language":"nl","bound_author_id":969300004,"text":"In deze verzameling columns kijkt Hanna Bervoets naar de manier waarop mensen zichzelf en elkaar begrijpen. Zij schrijft over familie, relaties en volwassen worden, maar ook over de beelden die media van het dagelijks leven maken. Persoonlijke situaties geven aanleiding tot vragen over identiteit en over gedrag dat vanzelfsprekend lijkt. De stukken staan los van elkaar en behouden de directe blik van de krantencolumn. Samen vormen ze een reeks observaties over het leven van een jonge volwassene en de wereld om haar heen.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/127424/leuk-zeg-doei.html","evidence":[{"type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p334622476"],"reference":"new-work-dossier-readings-061.json#223","checked_at":"2026-11-03T12:14:47.005Z","note":"Distinct2011firstcolumncollection, selectedDutchPaperbackthirdprinting2012 ISBN9789020412345. PublisherBureauISBN confirmsfirst2011printededitionand2012ebookseparately, exactprintretained. S